exit: 0
--- stdout
Print a file as syntax-highlighted HTML — <span class="lini-tok-*"> runs

Usage: executable highlight [OPTIONS] [INPUT]

Arguments:
  [INPUT]  Input .lini file (use '-' for stdin); omitted with --css

Options:
      --css   Print the token palette those spans wear, as a CSS file, instead
  -h, --help  Print help

